  "title": "Jennifer Cho",
  "summary": "Jennifer joined Immuneering as Associate Director, Clinical Scientist in 2026. She has over a decade of experience in oncology clinical trials, with prior experience as a Clinical Scientist on Phase I-III trials at Novartis, Celgene, and Regeneron. Jennifer also has site experience as a Research Pharmacist at Jacobi Medical Center and as a Study Coordinator at Dana-Farber Cancer Institute, as well […]",
